note bridge-strict-v1 selected-node placement policy, GGML API 3 at d327bf1f.
note Inputs are trusted adapter-derived facts, never self-authorizing labels.
note role: 1 metadata, 2 token embedding, 3 transformer including internal gathers.
note backend: 1 declared CPU, 2 exact qualified Omega device; all others refused.
note detail: GLU subtype (SWIGLU=2), otherwise zero. Returns 0 admit, 1 role,
note 2 op, 3 detail, 4 placement. Admission is NOT operator implementation support.
fn strictnode role ulong op ulong detail ulong backend ulong to ulong
if or lt role 1 gt role 3
ret 1
end
allowed = bool false
if eq role 1
allowed = or eq op 0 or eq op 36 or eq op 37 or eq op 38 eq op 39
end
if eq role 2
allowed = eq op 40
end
if eq role 3
allowed = or eq op 2 or eq op 7 or eq op 25 or eq op 29 or eq op 35 or eq op 40 or eq op 42 or eq op 46 or eq op 48 eq op 101
end
if not allowed
ret 2
end
if eq op 101
if ne detail 2
ret 3
end
else
if ne detail 0
ret 3
end
end
if eq role 1
if and ne backend 1 ne backend 2
ret 4
end
end
if and eq role 2 ne backend 1
ret 4
end
if and eq role 3 ne backend 2
ret 4
end
ret 0
end
